  "reasoning": "The defendants, as the actual controllers and legal representatives of the coal mine, neglected safety management, allowed unsafe production, which directly caused a fatal mine collapse. They also concealed the accident. Under Chinese criminal law, such conduct constitutes the crime of causing a major responsibility accident (重大责任事故罪) and may also involve the crime of concealing an accident (隐瞒事故罪). The appropriate charge label from the legal taxonomy is '重大责任事故罪'.",
